{"slug": "S02E06", "video_name": "Community - S02E06 - Epidemiology Bluray-1080p Proper.mkv", "subtitle_name": "Community - S02E06 - Epidemiology Bluray-1080p Proper.en.hi.srt", "duration_seconds": 1276.781, "language": "en", "stt_provider": "groq", "stt_model": "whisper-large-v3", "segment_count": 489, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 4.846153846153846, "text": "Halloween, a time of vampires, hobgoblins,"}, {"start": 4.846153846153846, "end": 9.0, "text": "dragons, boogans, and headless mice."}, {"start": 9.0, "end": 10.634615384615385, "text": "I'm George Takei."}, {"start": 10.634615384615385, "end": 11.980769230769232, "text": "You know what?"}, {"start": 11.980769230769232, "end": 14.0, "text": "Let's just get to it."}, {"start": 16.0, "end": 18.0, "text": "How is it?"}, {"start": 18.0, "end": 19.27536231884058, "text": "Pretty good taco, man."}, {"start": 19.27536231884058, "end": 22.0, "text": "I wonder how the dean scored this sweet spread."}, {"start": 22.0, "end": 26.0, "text": "Ah, ah, ah, Chef Gaga never reveals her caterer."}, {"start": 26.0, "end": 29.0, "text": "And don't try reading my p-p-p-poker bays."}, {"start": 29.88, "end": 32.6, "text": "It's military rations from an army surplus store."}, {"start": 35.1, "end": 36.38, "text": "I didn't read your poker face."}, {"start": 36.44, "end": 37.6, "text": "You left the containers in the garbage."}, {"start": 38.66, "end": 41.16, "text": "Oh, well, you guys have fun."}, {"start": 41.28, "end": 42.739998, "text": "I'm going to take out the garbage."}, {"start": 43.04, "end": 45.54, "text": "Oh, you may also want to adjust your iTunes setting"}, {"start": 45.54, "end": 48.88, "text": "when it's not playing an endless loop of Abba's greatest hits."}, {"start": 49.36, "end": 52.46, "text": "It's playing what I think may be your personal voice memos."}, {"start": 52.66, "end": 52.96, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 53.3, "end": 55.62, "text": "Note to self, get oil changed."}, {"start": 56.28, "end": 59.559998, "text": "Check Netflix for that movie where Greg Kinnear plays a ghost."}, {"start": 59.8, "end": 60.899998, "text": "No, an angel."}, {"start": 61.5, "end": 63.199997, "text": "And something called human sentiment."}, {"start": 66.22, "end": 67.18, "text": "David Beckham."}, {"start": 67.96, "end": 68.86, "text": "Dragon Turtle?"}, {"start": 69.479996, "end": 70.159996, "text": "T-Rex."}, {"start": 70.799995, "end": 73.05473405263157, "text": "Man, I wonder how much effort you put into"}, {"start": 73.05473405263157, "end": 75.9, "text": "being accidentally handsome for a costume every year."}, {"start": 76.24, "end": 79.04, "text": "Only half the effort you'll be putting into eating and drinking tonight."}, {"start": 79.52, "end": 81.439995, "text": "Let me help you, Dragon Turtle."}, {"start": 81.439995, "end": 85.02, "text": "Guys, Shirley's costume is once again unwittingly ambiguous."}, {"start": 85.02, "end": 88.52, "text": "I don't know what she's supposed to be, but I do know she's not Miss Piggy."}, {"start": 88.71999, "end": 90.92, "text": "I repeat, she is not Miss Piggy."}, {"start": 91.299995, "end": 92.06, "text": "You're on your own."}, {"start": 92.979996, "end": 93.38, "text": "Hello."}, {"start": 94.32, "end": 95.28, "text": "Guess who I am."}, {"start": 97.02, "end": 98.82, "text": "Um, can't you just say?"}, {"start": 98.96, "end": 99.35999, "text": "No."}, {"start": 102.96, "end": 104.079994, "text": "Pierce, are you okay?"}, {"start": 104.299995, "end": 104.55777499999999, "text": "Huh?"}, {"start": 104.55777499999999, "end": 104.88, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 107.159996, "end": 107.56, "text": "Whoa."}, {"start": 108.32, "end": 110.06, "text": "Hey, if you get any more sweaty and puffy,"}, {"start": 110.119995, "end": 112.34, "text": "your costume's going to reach new levels of authenticity."}, {"start": 112.64, "end": 113.52666244444445, "text": "I don't understand."}, {"start": 113.52666244444445, "end": 113.899994, "text": "Shut up."}, {"start": 115.02, "end": 117.85999, "text": "He's acting like the impression of him we do behind his back."}, {"start": 117.85999, "end": 118.079994, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 118.159996, "end": 118.64, "text": "Grandma!"}, {"start": 118.96, "end": 120.28, "text": "Where's the black boy in the uniform?"}, {"start": 121.35999, "end": 122.52, "text": "Leave me alone!"}, {"start": 122.67999, "end": 123.74, "text": "Get away from me!"}, {"start": 125.03999, "end": 127.2, "text": "Oh, man, just when you think it's funny."}, {"start": 127.479996, "end": 127.799995, "text": "Yours?"}, {"start": 128.54, "end": 129.72, "text": "Okay, okay, okay."}, {"start": 131.28, "end": 133.84, "text": "Excuse me, I think my friend is really sick."}, {"start": 134.08, "end": 134.87999, "text": "I'm not a doctor."}, {"start": 135.22, "end": 135.72, "text": "I'm a doctor."}, {"start": 137.28, "end": 139.37999, "text": "Annie, Rich from pottery class."}, {"start": 139.5, "end": 140.28, "text": "Oh, hey!"}, {"start": 140.48, "end": 141.2, "text": "Oh, hey."}, {"start": 141.72, "end": 142.81999, "text": "Wow, this looks serious."}, {"start": 143.14, "end": 144.62, "text": "Let's get him over here."}, {"start": 145.02, "end": 149.52139351851852, "text": "Okay Boy he is just not in a scary shape is he But"}, {"start": 149.52139351851852, "end": 154.74301, "text": "you look fantastic Oh thank you Look at you with your hood"}, {"start": 160.283, "end": 161.123, "text": "Rhybrid."}, {"start": 164.003, "end": 165.003, "text": "What is it?"}, {"start": 166.74301, "end": 168.343, "text": "Get away from those hotties!"}, {"start": 175.003, "end": 179.5702044, "text": "You're"}, {"start": 179.5702044, "end": 182.61500733333332, "text": "safe"}, {"start": 182.61500733333332, "end": 185.38301, "text": "now."}, {"start": 186.16301, "end": 189.46301, "text": "But if that thing comes back, I'm going to need one or both of your phone numbers."}, {"start": 189.94301, "end": 191.263, "text": "Yeah, right."}, {"start": 196.263, "end": 199.46301, "text": "I don't get it."}, {"start": 200.68301, "end": 201.68301, "text": "How do you do it?"}, {"start": 201.68301, "end": 204.32583352941177, "text": "Well, I'm wearing a $6,000 suit and you"}, {"start": 204.32583352941177, "end": 207.44301, "text": "spent three days making cardboard robot armor."}, {"start": 207.90302, "end": 209.263, "text": "You're saying they feel sorry for you."}, {"start": 209.763, "end": 213.16301, "text": "I'm saying I remind girls less of taking their little brothers to Comic-Con."}, {"start": 215.063, "end": 216.46301, "text": "Rich, more?"}, {"start": 217.223, "end": 218.063, "text": "Put it with the others."}, {"start": 219.30301, "end": 219.54817, "text": "102."}, {"start": 219.54817, "end": 221.203, "text": "This may be food poisoning."}, {"start": 221.52301, "end": 223.223, "text": "Rich, what did I tell you?"}, {"start": 223.44301, "end": 224.46301, "text": "To rule out food poisoning."}, {"start": 224.663, "end": 226.80301, "text": "Yes, but also not to say the words out loud."}, {"start": 227.18301, "end": 228.843, "text": "Who wants to walk my plank, huh?"}, {"start": 228.843, "end": 229.18301, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 231.68301, "end": 236.89443857142857, "text": "Okay, I'm ruling"}, {"start": 236.89443857142857, "end": 243.08301, "text": "out food poisoning."}, {"start": 245.823, "end": 249.143, "text": "Give me some more time in a dream"}, {"start": 249.143, "end": 252.30301, "text": "Give me the hope to run out of steam"}, {"start": 252.30301, "end": 255.663, "text": "Somebody say we could be here"}, {"start": 255.663, "end": 259.763, "text": "We could be both up and tired of bedding again"}, {"start": 259.763, "end": 264.103, "text": "I can't count the reasons I should stay"}, {"start": 264.103, "end": 268.983, "text": "One by one they all just fade away"}, {"start": 268.983, "end": 274.863, "text": "So when you need me darling"}, {"start": 274.863, "end": 276.72302, "text": "Guess who I am?"}, {"start": 277.28302, "end": 278.18298, "text": "Michelle Kwan?"}, {"start": 278.463, "end": 278.78302, "text": "Wrong."}, {"start": 279.403, "end": 280.30298, "text": "Krista Yamaguchi?"}, {"start": 280.72302, "end": 281.523, "text": "Peggy Fleming."}, {"start": 282.163, "end": 285.563, "text": "Just been proven racist by the racist prover."}, {"start": 287.123, "end": 289.663, "text": "Hey, guess who I am?"}, {"start": 289.763, "end": 291.763, "text": "Drink."}, {"start": 291.763, "end": 297.06678766467064, "text": "Have you noticed a weird vibe taking a hold of this party It like every fifth"}, {"start": 297.06678766467064, "end": 303.26602, "text": "person is on something seriously hardcore Yeah I wonder who holding the key to your riddle"}, {"start": 306.186, "end": 306.70602, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 307.366, "end": 307.60602, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 310.88602, "end": 311.746, "text": "Where's your costume?"}, {"start": 312.306, "end": 313.186, "text": "Trying something new."}, {"start": 313.646, "end": 314.586, "text": "But our costumes go together."}, {"start": 315.16602, "end": 317.446, "text": "And if you're not in yours, I'm just a guy in a spandex suit and a bike helmet."}, {"start": 317.626, "end": 319.306, "text": "Well, I'm a sexy Dracula."}, {"start": 319.82602, "end": 320.806, "text": "You mean vampire."}, {"start": 320.806, "end": 324.186, "text": "I don't need to know which Dracula I am to be a Dracula."}, {"start": 324.186, "end": 325.32602, "text": "You heard?"}, {"start": 331.48602, "end": 334.48602, "text": "Your symptoms are progressing even faster than everyone else's."}, {"start": 334.646, "end": 336.66602, "text": "How much of that taco meat stuff did you eat, Starbird?"}, {"start": 336.706, "end": 337.746, "text": "I didn't eat any."}, {"start": 338.406, "end": 339.586, "text": "My name's Alex."}, {"start": 340.006, "end": 342.126, "text": "Whatever it is must have transferred through Pierce's bite."}, {"start": 342.48602, "end": 343.706, "text": "My God, I think you're right."}, {"start": 344.586, "end": 346.226, "text": "You make quite the little nurse."}, {"start": 346.506, "end": 347.506, "text": "Thank you, Rich."}, {"start": 347.92603, "end": 349.446, "text": "You're quite a banana."}, {"start": 349.846, "end": 352.806, "text": "Geez, why don't you guys just get over here?"}, {"start": 354.186, "end": 360.2201011363636, "text": "But the only people getting sick are the ones"}, {"start": 360.2201011363636, "end": 365.98602, "text": "eating what I bought at your surplus store."}, {"start": 365.98602, "end": 369.6840431372549, "text": "Look, ma'am, I never said the stuff was delicious, but you can't get sick from it."}, {"start": 369.6840431372549, "end": 370.586, "text": "It's non-perishable."}, {"start": 370.646, "end": 372.206, "text": "What about the taco meat stuff?"}, {"start": 372.286, "end": 372.54602, "text": "The what?"}, {"start": 372.566, "end": 373.48602, "text": "The classic flavor?"}, {"start": 373.98602, "end": 374.38602, "text": "Huh?"}, {"start": 374.54602, "end": 376.26894411764704, "text": "The one with the goofy label?"}, {"start": 376.26894411764704, "end": 376.566, "text": "Here."}, {"start": 376.726, "end": 377.4260175, "text": "What's a goofy label?"}, {"start": 377.4260175, "end": 377.92603, "text": "What are you..."}, {"start": 377.92603, "end": 379.60250058823533, "text": "Classified Phoenix."}, {"start": 379.60250058823533, "end": 382.0730888235295, "text": "If found, repeat key phrase."}, {"start": 382.0730888235295, "end": 383.92603, "text": "Echo Tango X-Ray 997."}, {"start": 383.92603, "end": 385.506, "text": "Yeah, sounds delicious."}, {"start": 385.846, "end": 388.92603, "text": "Anyway, it looks like taco meat and..."}, {"start": 390.206, "end": 390.88602, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 391.406, "end": 392.566, "text": "Greendale Community College."}, {"start": 393.646, "end": 394.36603, "text": "Speaking."}, {"start": 394.86603, "end": 397.04602, "text": "This is Special Operations Officer McHenry."}, {"start": 398.306, "end": 399.006, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 399.54602, "end": 402.48602, "text": "I need you to listen to me very carefully."}, {"start": 403.82602, "end": 405.726, "text": "Okay, one hint."}, {"start": 406.026, "end": 407.98602, "text": "I'm a beloved character from Archon."}, {"start": 408.32602, "end": 409.86603, "text": "Can't stop seeing it."}, {"start": 409.88602, "end": 410.38602, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 410.38602, "end": 413.02430723404257, "text": "Leonard, behave yourself."}, {"start": 413.02430723404257, "end": 415.346, "text": "I'm a Christian woman."}, {"start": 416.286, "end": 418.86603, "text": "Leonard, you better back that pumpkin ass up or I will make a pie."}, {"start": 421.36603, "end": 421.884205, "text": "Hey, Jeff."}, {"start": 421.884205, "end": 423.646, "text": "It's me, Rich, from pottery class."}, {"start": 424.326, "end": 425.42603, "text": "Doc Potterywood, remember?"}, {"start": 425.60602, "end": 426.526, "text": "Rich, bigger fish."}, {"start": 427.026, "end": 428.95660000000004, "text": "Guys, there's some kind of infection at the party"}, {"start": 428.95660000000004, "end": 430.966, "text": "that's making people act weird and bite each other."}, {"start": 430.966, "end": 434.506, "text": "We need to coordinate an orderly evacuation without causing unnecessary pain."}, {"start": 436.54602, "end": 438.446, "text": "Holy crap, Leonard's a zombie!"}, {"start": 440.386, "end": 442.966, "text": "Zombie attack!"}, {"start": 446.146, "end": 448.369, "text": "I out Oh my God"}, {"start": 460.369, "end": 463.309, "text": "Um, I'm sorry."}, {"start": 463.649, "end": 464.409, "text": "I'm sorry!"}, {"start": 464.809, "end": 468.229, "text": "I've been told we need a little baby quarantine until the army gets here."}, {"start": 468.229, "end": 470.549, "text": "I know, right?"}, {"start": 471.489, "end": 473.249, "text": "They said to wait for six hours."}, {"start": 474.029, "end": 474.989, "text": "Stay strong!"}, {"start": 475.009, "end": 478.689, "text": "Guys, I hate to be the We've Got Company guy, but..."}, {"start": 478.689, "end": 478.889, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 484.309, "end": 486.36902, "text": "Hey, guess who I am."}, {"start": 488.529, "end": 489.449, "text": "Or don't."}, {"start": 491.469, "end": 492.549, "text": "Hey, to the back!"}, {"start": 492.549, "end": 492.889, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 494.36902, "end": 495.389, "text": "Got me first!"}, {"start": 498.389, "end": 498.689, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 500.649, "end": 501.249, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 502.169, "end": 502.449, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 502.449, "end": 502.529, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 502.529, "end": 503.049, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 503.049, "end": 503.109, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 503.109, "end": 503.169, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 503.169, "end": 503.92902, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 503.92902, "end": 503.989, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 503.989, "end": 504.029, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 504.029, "end": 504.049, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 504.049, "end": 504.069, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 504.069, "end": 504.309, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 504.309, "end": 504.329, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 504.329, "end": 504.349, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 504.349, "end": 504.36902, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 504.36902, "end": 504.389, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 504.389, "end": 504.409, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 504.409, "end": 504.469, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 504.469, "end": 504.509, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 504.509, "end": 504.549, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 504.549, "end": 504.609, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 504.609, "end": 504.669, "text": "Woo!"}, {"start": 505.009, "end": 506.309, "text": "Oh, shoot!"}, {"start": 508.529, "end": 510.409, "text": "You punched a lady bee!"}, {"start": 514.50903, "end": 518.129, "text": "Let go of the door, you little bitch!"}, {"start": 518.569, "end": 518.969, "text": "Welcome!"}, {"start": 519.529, "end": 520.989, "text": "Oh, thank God you're all right!"}, {"start": 520.989, "end": 521.689, "text": "Shut the door!"}, {"start": 522.849, "end": 523.829, "text": "Oh, he did it!"}, {"start": 528.269, "end": 530.469, "text": "Okay, did we lose anybody out there?"}, {"start": 530.689, "end": 531.069, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 531.189, "end": 531.829, "text": "Did anybody hurt?"}, {"start": 531.989, "end": 532.349, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 532.489, "end": 534.709, "text": "Okay, last question, and I know it's a long shot,"}, {"start": 534.709, "end": 537.189, "text": "but did anybody happen to shut off the Dean's playlist?"}, {"start": 537.369, "end": 540.549, "text": "2% milk, eggs, deodorant, puppy chow, black light,"}, {"start": 540.709, "end": 541.609, "text": "whole milk, not for drinking."}, {"start": 541.609, "end": 541.829, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 542.269, "end": 542.889, "text": "Cotton swab."}, {"start": 543.029, "end": 544.289, "text": "It's officially a waking nightmare."}, {"start": 544.669, "end": 547.709, "text": "Add Eat, Pray, Love soundtrack to workout mix."}, {"start": 549.409, "end": 551.189, "text": "When are the police coming?"}, {"start": 551.769, "end": 552.209, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 553.429, "end": 553.909, "text": "Hello?"}, {"start": 556.529, "end": 557.909, "text": "Flava Flava's right."}, {"start": 558.149, "end": 559.369, "text": "It's the end of days."}, {"start": 559.629, "end": 561.089, "text": "It can't be the end of days."}, {"start": 561.209, "end": 562.529, "text": "It's not 2012 yet."}, {"start": 562.869, "end": 563.969, "text": "It's not the end of days."}, {"start": 563.969, "end": 566.5237663551402, "text": "Seems to be a rabies-related pathogen affecting the"}, {"start": 566.5237663551402, "end": 569.329, "text": "prefrontal cortex of the brain, causing hyperaggression."}, {"start": 569.629, "end": 571.50903, "text": "It could take years for it to take over the world."}, {"start": 571.609, "end": 572.269, "text": "How many years?"}, {"start": 572.469, "end": 573.429, "text": "One, one and a half."}, {"start": 574.729, "end": 576.169, "text": "2012, end of days!"}, {"start": 576.349, "end": 578.069, "text": "End of days, end of days!"}, {"start": 579.029, "end": 580.0172352941177, "text": "Good thinking, Jeff."}, {"start": 580.0172352941177, "end": 580.709, "text": "Vertical fold."}, {"start": 581.809, "end": 582.789, "text": "You making fun of me?"}, {"start": 583.789, "end": 587.149, "text": "That jacket is worth more than the island you've grown on, Chiquita MD."}, {"start": 588.00903, "end": 588.7399227272728, "text": "Chiquita MD."}, {"start": 588.7399227272728, "end": 589.349, "text": "I like it."}, {"start": 589.50903, "end": 591.68896, "text": "Rich, this is a good time to let you know that I hate you."}, {"start": 591.749, "end": 593.169, "text": "Shouldn't we be barricading the room?"}, {"start": 593.169, "end": 593.649, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 593.969, "end": 595.969, "text": "These guys don't seem to be..."}, {"start": 595.969, "end": 596.80896, "text": "I will help you."}, {"start": 596.80896, "end": 597.769, "text": "Wait, wait!"}, {"start": 597.769, "end": 600.0, "text": "Before you barricade us in, I need to ask if anyone"}, {"start": 600.0, "end": 600.5, "text": "It's been bitten."}, {"start": 600.5, "end": 601.0, "text": "You bit?"}, {"start": 601.0, "end": 601.5, "text": "Huh?"}, {"start": 601.5, "end": 602.8, "text": "You bit?"}, {"start": 602.8, "end": 605.16, "text": "This pathogen is spread through bites."}, {"start": 605.16, "end": 607.7599998, "text": "So if anyone has been bitten and you allow us to seal ourselves"}, {"start": 607.7599998, "end": 611.639999, "text": "in here with you, you're putting us all in danger."}, {"start": 611.639999, "end": 612.44, "text": "All right, go ahead."}, {"start": 612.44, "end": 613.12, "text": "Nice."}, {"start": 613.12, "end": 613.92, "text": "I got the middle."}, {"start": 613.92, "end": 616.82, "text": "Huh?"}, {"start": 616.82, "end": 618.0, "text": "Paracade?"}, {"start": 618.0, "end": 620.0, "text": "Are we really just going to sit here?"}, {"start": 620.0, "end": 622.0, "text": "The army's going to be here in six hours."}, {"start": 622.0, "end": 623.24, "text": "Why six hours?"}, {"start": 623.24, "end": 624.4, "text": "Are they hosting the Oscars?"}, {"start": 624.4, "end": 625.439999, "text": "Damn."}, {"start": 625.439999, "end": 627.64, "text": "And the winner for best adapted Oscar burn,"}, {"start": 627.64, "end": 630.119999, "text": "Jeff Winger for Oh Snap, the man who went there."}, {"start": 630.24, "end": 631.64, "text": "Those people don't have six hours."}, {"start": 632.04, "end": 633.82, "text": "Judging from the temperatures of those infected,"}, {"start": 634.6, "end": 636.899998, "text": "in three hours they're going to start suffering from brain damage."}, {"start": 637.0, "end": 638.579998, "text": "Three hours after that, they're going to be dead."}, {"start": 638.68, "end": 638.9299997368421, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 638.9299997368421, "end": 640.579998, "text": "We have to do something for them."}, {"start": 640.68, "end": 642.76, "text": "Do something for the zombies."}, {"start": 643.14, "end": 644.739998, "text": "If we lower the temperature of the whole building,"}, {"start": 645.059998, "end": 646.559998, "text": "would it break the fever and kill the virus?"}, {"start": 647.84, "end": 648.559998, "text": "It might."}, {"start": 649.879997, "end": 651.0498083207547, "text": "I know where the thermostat is."}, {"start": 651.0498083207547, "end": 651.879997, "text": "Out there on the wall."}, {"start": 652.719997, "end": 654.8, "text": "Troy, we have to rise to the occasion like Ripley"}, {"start": 654.8, "end": 656.02, "text": "and kick Monster Butt in our undies."}, {"start": 656.02, "end": 657.219997, "text": "I'm not Ripley, Abed."}, {"start": 657.64, "end": 659.38, "text": "I'm a cool, sexy Dracula."}, {"start": 659.62, "end": 661.1, "text": "I make love to ladies and I survive."}, {"start": 661.3, "end": 661.94, "text": "I'm with Troy."}, {"start": 662.12, "end": 664.02, "text": "Guys, those are not zombies."}, {"start": 664.24, "end": 665.94, "text": "Those are our classmates and they're sick."}, {"start": 666.24, "end": 668.06, "text": "And they can make us sick by biting us."}, {"start": 668.12, "end": 669.08, "text": "The banana said so."}, {"start": 669.159996, "end": 669.5, "text": "It's true."}, {"start": 669.94, "end": 671.06, "text": "The incubation only takes minutes."}, {"start": 671.72, "end": 672.7, "text": "First you get a stomach ache,"}, {"start": 672.96, "end": 674.04, "text": "then your skin turns red,"}, {"start": 674.1800000000001, "end": 675.14, "text": "followed by cold sweats,"}, {"start": 675.659996, "end": 676.96, "text": "muscle spasms, high fever,"}, {"start": 677.74, "end": 682.1309298696846, "text": "then the uncontrollable urge to bite uninfected"}, {"start": 682.1309298696846, "end": 685.3073472222222, "text": "flesh Oh jeez I forgot one symptom"}, {"start": 685.3073472222222, "end": 691.029, "text": "Slurred speed Whoa You got bit I felt like maybe I was special"}, {"start": 691.029, "end": 691.989, "text": "Special?"}, {"start": 691.989, "end": 693.409, "text": "You're not special."}, {"start": 693.409, "end": 694.609, "text": "I'm special."}, {"start": 694.609, "end": 696.989, "text": "I was bit 10 minutes ago, and I'm..."}, {"start": 696.989, "end": 699.609, "text": "Great!"}, {"start": 699.609, "end": 702.109, "text": "Nobody's special!"}, {"start": 702.109, "end": 705.109, "text": "Hey, Rex, just so you know, I hate you less now."}, {"start": 705.109, "end": 707.909, "text": "That's how much I hate your normal self."}, {"start": 707.909, "end": 709.749, "text": "You have to destroy the brain."}, {"start": 718.369, "end": 719.009, "text": "Hamster!"}, {"start": 720.149, "end": 721.169, "text": "A hamster!"}, {"start": 721.169, "end": 721.769, "text": "There you go."}, {"start": 721.869, "end": 722.2090000000001, "text": "Run!"}, {"start": 722.289, "end": 722.589005, "text": "Run!"}, {"start": 722.7090000000001, "end": 723.029, "text": "Run!"}, {"start": 723.149, "end": 723.469, "text": "Run!"}, {"start": 729.969, "end": 736.729, "text": "What about Manny?"}, {"start": 736.729, "end": 738.009, "text": "Don't look back!"}, {"start": 740.389, "end": 741.02899, "text": "Shirley!"}, {"start": 742.189, "end": 743.409, "text": "Don't look back!"}, {"start": 745.569, "end": 746.869, "text": "Come on, come on, come on!"}, {"start": 749.509, "end": 750.689, "text": "We have to go help them."}, {"start": 751.469, "end": 753.52899, "text": "We have to help them by getting bit."}, {"start": 754.389, "end": 755.389, "text": "It's occupied!"}, {"start": 756.869, "end": 757.509, "text": "Occupied!"}, {"start": 758.4490000000001, "end": 759.8489999999999, "text": "Oh, this is our guy."}, {"start": 760.32901, "end": 761.229, "text": "It's Miss Piggy."}, {"start": 761.869, "end": 762.80899, "text": "You're not Miss Piggy."}, {"start": 763.2090000000001, "end": 768.3869318181819, "text": "You Glenda the Good Witch Just so you know"}, {"start": 768.3869318181819, "end": 774.058, "text": "I always loved Peggy Fleming You not racist Mm"}, {"start": 785.67801, "end": 786.39801, "text": "Get in."}, {"start": 786.67801, "end": 787.018, "text": "Get in."}, {"start": 790.218, "end": 791.218, "text": "Oh, cool."}, {"start": 791.998, "end": 793.158, "text": "A dark basement."}, {"start": 793.158, "end": 795.998, "text": "I was just thinking we should be doing this in a dark basement."}, {"start": 797.358, "end": 798.818, "text": "Troy, why did you ditch your custom?"}, {"start": 799.638, "end": 801.1203529411765, "text": "Why bring that up now, Abed?"}, {"start": 801.1203529411765, "end": 802.338, "text": "We might die down here."}, {"start": 802.838, "end": 804.058, "text": "All the more reason to get this ironed out."}, {"start": 804.6179999999999, "end": 805.538, "text": "You called me a nerd up there."}, {"start": 806.038, "end": 806.918, "text": "What defines a nerd?"}, {"start": 807.338, "end": 809.738, "text": "Committing to an awesome Halloween custom with your best friend?"}, {"start": 809.9580100000001, "end": 810.658, "text": "Is that what nerds do?"}, {"start": 810.778, "end": 812.718, "text": "I don't know, Abed, because I'm not a nerd."}, {"start": 812.898, "end": 815.218, "text": "Which is why I'm not taking part in this nerdy conversation."}, {"start": 815.338, "end": 815.9580100000001, "text": "Shh, nerds!"}, {"start": 817.558, "end": 818.398, "text": "Did you hear that?"}, {"start": 821.398, "end": 821.918, "text": "Jeez!"}, {"start": 823.158, "end": 825.408, "text": "It was just a cat."}, {"start": 825.408, "end": 827.658, "text": "Let's keep moving."}, {"start": 830.65799, "end": 831.578, "text": "Holy crap!"}, {"start": 836.258, "end": 838.198, "text": "What is up with that cat?"}, {"start": 838.258, "end": 839.718, "text": "Is someone throwing it?"}, {"start": 839.87799, "end": 840.238, "text": "Let's keep moving."}, {"start": 841.518, "end": 845.67801, "text": "Let's not keep moving, because there is an insane cat down here."}, {"start": 845.818, "end": 846.798, "text": "What about the zombies?"}, {"start": 847.17801, "end": 851.0876231249999, "text": "Back burner Troy This cat has to be dealt with There it is Grab it"}, {"start": 851.0876231249999, "end": 855.94502125, "text": "Get out Let go through there Okay that dorsal lead upstairs the thermostat will be"}, {"start": 855.94502125, "end": 860.447, "text": "right up there Enough with the thermostat Abed This is not pretend play time"}, {"start": 860.767, "end": 861.8908095238096, "text": "save the world time."}, {"start": 861.8908095238096, "end": 865.2060476190477, "text": "It's quarter past, let's get the hell out of this building."}, {"start": 865.2060476190477, "end": 865.4870000000001, "text": "Time."}, {"start": 867.547, "end": 868.552, "text": "There, there's a window."}, {"start": 868.552, "end": 871.567, "text": "All right, if we climb that dusty fence, we can hoist each other against"}, {"start": 871.567, "end": 874.2777368421052, "text": "the wall and then squeeze through it."}, {"start": 874.2777368421052, "end": 876.036052631579, "text": "I vote we take the door."}, {"start": 876.036052631579, "end": 878.527, "text": "He doesn't want to dirty his suit."}, {"start": 878.827, "end": 880.387, "text": "For real?"}, {"start": 880.867, "end": 882.1469999999999, "text": "Close make the man, Troy."}, {"start": 882.6669999999999, "end": 883.3709853333334, "text": "What the..."}, {"start": 883.3709853333334, "end": 883.62698, "text": "Hey!"}, {"start": 888.62698, "end": 890.12698, "text": "That's my jacket!"}, {"start": 891.267, "end": 892.62698, "text": "My jacket!"}, {"start": 892.767, "end": 893.947, "text": "You're stretching it!"}, {"start": 894.107, "end": 895.6669999999999, "text": "You're stretching it!"}, {"start": 897.6669999999999, "end": 898.617, "text": "Go back!"}, {"start": 898.617, "end": 899.567, "text": "Go back!"}, {"start": 899.767, "end": 900.387, "text": "Go back!"}, {"start": 930.387, "end": 930.887, "text": "Go."}, {"start": 930.887, "end": 932.387, "text": "I'm not going without you."}, {"start": 932.387, "end": 934.427, "text": "Troy, make me proud."}, {"start": 934.427, "end": 938.406, "text": "Be the first black man to get to the end."}, {"start": 938.406, "end": 940.1859999999999, "text": "Go, go, go, go!"}, {"start": 942.406, "end": 943.2259997, "text": "Pop it!"}, {"start": 946.126, "end": 947.106, "text": "I love you."}, {"start": 947.726, "end": 948.0859989999999, "text": "I know."}, {"start": 950.746, "end": 951.906, "text": "Make it fast!"}, {"start": 952.0659999999999, "end": 952.406, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 965.1229989999999, "end": 967.2429999999999, "text": "Troy, be honest."}, {"start": 967.563, "end": 968.5314843333333, "text": "Are you a zombie?"}, {"start": 968.5314843333333, "end": 969.442999, "text": "I will mace you."}, {"start": 969.442999, "end": 970.202999, "text": "Give me the keys."}, {"start": 970.202999, "end": 973.203, "text": "Those people are gonna get brain damage if someone doesn't help them."}, {"start": 973.203, "end": 976.203, "text": "Detroit, there is something called chain of command, so unfortunately..."}, {"start": 976.203, "end": 976.703, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 976.703, "end": 977.203, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 980.203, "end": 980.9807777777778, "text": "Are you crazy?"}, {"start": 980.9807777777778, "end": 983.203, "text": "How are you gonna survive those zombies?"}, {"start": 985.203, "end": 986.203, "text": "I'm gonna be a nerd."}, {"start": 988.203, "end": 990.203, "text": "Better have a plan B!"}, {"start": 990.203, "end": 995.463, "text": "That's"}, {"start": 995.463, "end": 1000.723, "text": "right."}, {"start": 1001.703, "end": 1003.923, "text": "Prepare to meet the power of imagination."}, {"start": 1008.663, "end": 1009.103, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 1009.562996, "end": 1011.2629999999999, "text": "I don't know why I thought this would work."}, {"start": 1011.463, "end": 1012.723, "text": "Hey, get off me!"}, {"start": 1013.0229949999999, "end": 1013.5029999999999, "text": "Get off!"}, {"start": 1013.562996, "end": 1014.562996, "text": "You're so strong!"}, {"start": 1015.202995, "end": 1016.242996, "text": "God, I hate this!"}, {"start": 1016.803, "end": 1017.3829949999999, "text": "Get off!"}, {"start": 1017.5029999999999, "end": 1022.239682236842, "text": "Stop using your mouth Hello zombie Annie What"}, {"start": 1022.239682236842, "end": 1025.50273, "text": "big fists you have In your face"}, {"start": 1029.46273, "end": 1030.92274, "text": "Keep this up, Scotty!"}, {"start": 1031.382736, "end": 1032.36273, "text": "In your face!"}, {"start": 1037.3027339999999, "end": 1038.18273, "text": "Zombie Shirley,"}, {"start": 1038.342735, "end": 1040.06274, "text": "I don't know what you are, but"}, {"start": 1040.06274, "end": 1041.44273, "text": "in your face!"}, {"start": 1043.622734, "end": 1043.94273, "text": "Robin!"}, {"start": 1043.94273, "end": 1044.04273, "text": "Robin!"}, {"start": 1045.202736, "end": 1045.90273, "text": "We're friends!"}, {"start": 1047.3027339999999, "end": 1048.202736, "text": "Robin, no!"}, {"start": 1048.26273, "end": 1048.6554589090908, "text": "Ah!"}, {"start": 1048.6554589090908, "end": 1049.702736, "text": "Burn up!"}, {"start": 1050.96273, "end": 1051.753355, "text": "Okay, okay."}, {"start": 1051.753355, "end": 1053.26273, "text": "I've been bit, y'all."}, {"start": 1053.7827399999999, "end": 1054.858528, "text": "Hey, congrats."}, {"start": 1054.858528, "end": 1056.702736, "text": "You did what zombies do."}, {"start": 1069.08273, "end": 1072.04273, "text": "Jeff, still cool as a zombie."}, {"start": 1078.26273, "end": 1083.6307624967062, "text": "I was so afraid from end of the"}, {"start": 1083.6307624967062, "end": 1089.691444347826, "text": "year When we were young and full of"}, {"start": 1089.691444347826, "end": 1095.746957173913, "text": "life And all of us could play today"}, {"start": 1095.746957173913, "end": 1101.80247, "text": "And I not ashamed to say Good night"}, {"start": 1130.44247, "end": 1131.74247, "text": "Fernando"}, {"start": 1131.74247, "end": 1136.30247, "text": "Though we never thought that we could lose"}, {"start": 1136.30247, "end": 1138.18247, "text": "There's no regret"}, {"start": 1138.18247, "end": 1145.08247, "text": "Lock down perimeter!"}, {"start": 1145.68246, "end": 1146.36246, "text": "We got movement inside!"}, {"start": 1146.36246, "end": 1146.86246, "text": "In position!"}, {"start": 1146.86246, "end": 1147.36246, "text": "In position!"}, {"start": 1147.60247, "end": 1147.94247, "text": "Speaking."}, {"start": 1148.68246, "end": 1150.48248, "text": "Wow, six hours on the dot."}, {"start": 1150.72247, "end": 1152.0624599999999, "text": "Yeah, well, practice makes perfect."}, {"start": 1152.64246, "end": 1153.36246, "text": "You the only witness?"}, {"start": 1153.94247, "end": 1154.72247, "text": "I am."}, {"start": 1156.0224699999999, "end": 1157.88247, "text": "Hey, we got uninfected in here."}, {"start": 1158.14246, "end": 1159.10247, "text": "How many we talking?"}, {"start": 1159.10247, "end": 1160.94247, "text": "I think it might be all of them."}, {"start": 1162.0624599999999, "end": 1162.62246, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 1163.00246, "end": 1163.66247, "text": "Scenario B."}, {"start": 1163.80247, "end": 1164.0424699999999, "text": "Repeat."}, {"start": 1164.18246, "end": 1164.8424599999998, "text": "Scenario B."}, {"start": 1165.44247, "end": 1166.86246, "text": "Let's dose these suckers."}, {"start": 1167.14246, "end": 1168.08247, "text": "Dose what now?"}, {"start": 1168.22247, "end": 1168.44247, "text": "Dose."}, {"start": 1169.66247, "end": 1170.38247, "text": "Throw it in."}, {"start": 1171.58247, "end": 1172.64246, "text": "Scenario B."}, {"start": 1180.14246, "end": 1181.24247, "text": "I don't remember anything."}, {"start": 1182.24247, "end": 1187.8293148837208, "text": "There you go You remember nothing past your decision to be Lady"}, {"start": 1187.8293148837208, "end": 1193.6822, "text": "Gaga I can believe that somebody would mass Roofie an entire party"}, {"start": 1194.0022, "end": 1195.1422, "text": "I can't believe it wasn't me."}, {"start": 1195.3822, "end": 1196.5822, "text": "I can't believe I believe you."}, {"start": 1197.1221799999998, "end": 1198.0421999999999, "text": "And I don't."}, {"start": 1199.6221799999998, "end": 1200.6422, "text": "Want to watch a movie?"}, {"start": 1201.5821999999998, "end": 1201.8622, "text": "Sure."}, {"start": 1202.6822, "end": 1203.9622, "text": "Aliens, cyborgs, or zombies?"}, {"start": 1204.3622, "end": 1207.3022, "text": "I don't know why, but I'm kind of over zombies."}, {"start": 1207.9422, "end": 1209.8222, "text": "Yeah, I don't feel like anything action-heavy."}, {"start": 1210.3222, "end": 1211.2622, "text": "How about something light?"}, {"start": 1211.7222, "end": 1212.5421999999999, "text": "You see Marmaduke?"}, {"start": 1212.6221799999998, "end": 1218.2222, "text": "And so Troy and Ahmed went back to the dormitory for the viewing of Marmaduke."}, {"start": 1218.9222, "end": 1221.6622, "text": "I'm George Takei, and if your name is Kevin,"}, {"start": 1221.6622, "end": 1224.4022, "text": "here's a little freebie for your cell phone."}, {"start": 1225.2622, "end": 1227.3737789473682, "text": "Hi, Kevin can't come to the phone."}, {"start": 1227.3737789473682, "end": 1229.9822, "text": "He's on a spaceship with me, George Takei."}, {"start": 1230.2822, "end": 1231.2822, "text": "Please leave a message."}, {"start": 1232.1822, "end": 1233.4422, "text": "You're welcome, Kevins."}, {"start": 1234.8622, "end": 1235.9222, "text": "Happy Halloween."}, {"start": 1240.9412, "end": 1241.5812, "text": "Voicemail."}, {"start": 1241.5812, "end": 1244.7612, "text": "October 31st, 1120 p.m."}, {"start": 1244.7612, "end": 1246.140152631579, "text": "Troy, this is Chang."}, {"start": 1246.140152631579, "end": 1247.6570005263159, "text": "There's not much time."}, {"start": 1247.6570005263159, "end": 1250.00122, "text": "I don't think we're gonna make it."}, {"start": 1250.6412, "end": 1255.2212, "text": "Listen, if you survive, please spread this message for me."}, {"start": 1256.0612, "end": 1258.2212, "text": "Shirley and I totally did it."}, {"start": 1258.28118, "end": 1258.438516, "text": "Shh!"}, {"start": 1258.438516, "end": 1259.4612, "text": "Chang, what are you doing?"}, {"start": 1259.6012, "end": 1259.8611999999998, "text": "Nothing."}, {"start": 1261.1412, "end": 1261.9612, "text": "Gotta go!"}, {"start": 1265.7012, "end": 1267.1812, "text": "Why did he call me?"}]}